# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
#
# Nothing in this repository should ever contain a credential. `.env.example` is
# the committed template; every real value lives in an untracked `.env` or in the
# process environment. The deny-then-allow shape below means a new secret-ish
# filename is ignored by default rather than having to be remembered.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
!example.env

ovis.toml
*.local.toml

# Keys, certificates, tokens
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.token
*_token
.netrc
.pgpass
secrets/
.secrets/
credentials.json
gcp-credentials.json
service-account*.json

# Cookie jars, if anyone runs the manual Onyx login flow by hand
*.cookies

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/target
**/target
*.rs.bk
*.pdb

ui/node_modules
# The built UI is a build artifact: `vite build` wipes and rewrites ui/dist,
# and ovis-backend's build.rs creates the (possibly empty) folder for
# rust-embed — so nothing under it is tracked, not even a placeholder.
ui/dist/
ui/.vite
ui/coverage
ui/scripts/shots/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent and tooling scratch
#
# `.agents/` held prior multi-agent session transcripts. They quoted the
# production database password in 29 files — exactly what must never reach a
# commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.agents/
.claude/
*.log
!ops/*.log

# Pre-redesign design documents. Superseded by redesign/ in full; kept locally
# for archaeology, never pushed. (Also purged from git history before the
# remote existed.)
implementation/

# Obsidian's per-machine pane/tab state, which changes every time the vault is
# opened. The shared vault settings (app/appearance/core-plugins) stay tracked.
redesign/.obsidian/workspace.json
redesign/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and operating systems
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python leftovers from the deleted simulator suite
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# The original kickoff request — same class as implementation/: kept locally,
# never pushed (purged from history alongside it).
ORIGINAL_REQUEST.md
